        "headline": "紐幾內亞航空PX19右發動機出現火警指示 轉降達沃146人滑梯撤離無人受傷",
        "summary": "紐幾內亞航空PX19由香港飛往莫爾茲比港途中，波音767-300右發動機出現火警指示，機組關閉發動機後轉降菲律賓達沃。137名乘客及9名機組員安全降落後經滑梯撤離，無人受傷；4條主輪胎洩氣，實際是否起火仍待調查。達沃機場一度暫停其他航班起降，兩班國內抵達航班取消，檢查後恢復運作。",
        "headline_en": "Air Niugini PX19 diverts to Davao after right-engine fire indication; all 146 evacuate uninjured",
        "summary_en": "Air Niugini's PX19, a Boeing 767-300 flying from Hong Kong to Port Moresby, diverted to Davao in the Philippines after a right-engine fire indication. The crew shut down the engine, and all 137 passengers and nine crew evacuated by slide after a safe landing, with no injuries. Four main tyres deflated; whether an actual fire occurred remains under investigation. Davao airport temporarily suspended other flights, two arriving domestic flights were cancelled, and operations resumed after checks.",
